<p data-start="158" data-end="399">To design it properly, Iâ€™ll outline below a <strong data-start="202" data-end="226">modular architecture</strong> that covers your main theoretical needs (RSVP, DAG-RSVP, TARTAN, FPC, semantic/entropic dynamics), and then we can generate each module step by step as real Python scripts.</p>
