<h2 data-start="406" data-end="447">ğŸ§  Overview: RSVP Analysis Suite (RAS)</h2>
<p data-start="449" data-end="535">A <strong data-start="451" data-end="488">modular scientific software suite</strong> to model, simulate, and analyze your theories.</p>
<h3 data-start="537" data-end="560"><strong data-start="541" data-end="560">1. Core Modules</strong></h3>
