-start="1045" data-end="1091" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1047" data-end="1065">gray_code_tile()</code>, <code data-start="1067" data-end="1089">entropy_tiling_map()</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1092" data-end="1225"><td data-start="1092" data-end="1118" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1094" data-end="1117"><code data-start="1096" data-end="1115">semantic_phase.py</code></strong></td><td data-start="1118" data-end="1181" data-col-size="md">Models semantic manifolds, information geometry, and Ï†_RSVP.</td><td data-start="1181" data-end="1225" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1183" data-end="1202">semantic_metric()</code>, <code data-start="1204" data-end="1223">phase_evolution()</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1226" data-end="1372"><td data-start="1226" data-end="1250" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1228" data-end="1249"><code data-start="1230" data-end="1247">bv_formalism.py</code></strong></td><td data-start="1250" data-end="1320" data-col-size="md">Implements BRST/BV differential, antifields, ghosts, and CME tests.</td><td data-start="1320" data-end="1372" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1322" data-end="1342">build_bv_complex()</code>, <code data-start="1344" data-end="1370">verify_master_equation()</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1373" data-end="1496"><td data-start="1373" data-end="1397" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1375" data-end="1396"><code data-start="1377" data-end="1394">fpc_dynamics.py</code></strong></td><td data-start="1397" data-end="1453" data-col-size="md">Fixed-Point Causality simulator for feedback systems.</td><td data-start="1453" data-end="1496" data-col-size="md"><code data-start="1455" data-end="1471">simulate_fpc()</code>, <code data-start="1473" data-end="1494">find_fixed_points()</code></td></tr><tr data-start="1497" data-end="1636"><td data-start="1497" data-end="1517" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1499" data-end="1516"><code data-start="1501" data-end="1514">data_viz.py</code></strong