<p data-start="1073" data-end="1317">So in summary, we have <strong data-start="1096" data-end="1225">all the core utilities, core modules (except derived_geometry and bv_formalism), config, I/O, plotting, FPC dynamics, and CLI</strong>, but the <code data-start="1235" data-end="1246">analysis/</code> modules and the two remaining core theory modules are still pending.</p>
