n></span><span class="hidden sm:block"><button class="flex items-center gap-1 py-1 ps-1.5 pe-2.5 select-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50">Download</button></span></div><div class="hover:text-token-text-primary"><button class="btn relative btn-primary -my-1 -me-3 flex items-center gap-1 py-1 select-none"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="" data-state="closed"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="block sm:hidden"><path d="M6 14.7229V5.27708C6 4.29072 7.08894 3.69295 7.9211 4.22251L15.3428 8.94541C16.1147 9.43661 16.1147 10.5634 15.3428 11.0546L7.92109 15.7775C7.08894 16.307 6 15.7093 6 14.7229Z"></path></svg></span><span class="hidden sm:block">Run code</span></div></button></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1 flex-col self-end"><div class="relative flex min-h-0 flex-auto flex-col overflow-hidden border-t transition-colors border-transparent"><section class="popover flex h-full w-full flex-col bg-transparent"><section class="relative flex min-h-0 flex-auto grow flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="block h-auto"><div class="flex justify-start h-full" style="margin: 0px 16px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex h-full max-w-full"><div id="codemirror" class="_codemirror_hsqxh_1 _preview_hsqxh_26 z-10 flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch" style="width: 0px;"><div class="cm-editor Í¼1 Í¼2 Í¼13 Í¼14 Í¼12"><div class="cm-announced" aria-live="polite"></div><div tabindex="-1" class="cm-scroller" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><div spellcheck="false" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" translate="no" contenteditable="false" style="tab-size: 4;" class="cm-content" role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-readonly="true"><div class="cm-line">"""</div><div class="cm-line">bv_formalism.py</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">Batalin-Vilkovisky (BV) formalism utilities for RSVP Analysis Suite (RAS).</div><div class="cm-line">This module provides:</div><div class="cm-line">- placeholder BV operator construction for scalar/vector fields</div><div class="cm-line">- ghost/antifield bookkeeping (toy structures)</div><div class="cm-line">- classical master equation (CME) evaluation on discrete fields</div><div class="cm-line">- simple antibracket computations</div><div class="cm-line">- demo harness illustrating basic operations</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">This is a computational scaffold for exploring RSVP theory with derived and entropic fields.</div><div class="cm-line">"""</div><div class="cm-line">from __future__ import annotations</div><div class="cm-line">from typing import Tuple</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">import numpy as np</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"># ----------------------------- Ghost / antifield bookkeeping -----------------------------</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">def initialize_ghosts(field_shape: Tuple[int, ...], ghost_dim: int) -&gt; np.ndarray:</div><div class="cm-line">    """Create a ghost field array corresponding to the base field."""</div><div class="cm-line">    return np.zeros(field_shape + (ghost_dim,))</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">def initialize_antifields(field_shape: Tuple[int, ...], fiber_dim: int) -&gt; np.ndarray:</div><div class="cm-line">    """Create an antifield array corresponding to the base field."""</div><div class="cm-line">    return np.zeros(field_shape + (fiber_dim,))</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"># ----------------------------- Antibracket computation -----------------------------</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">def antibracket(F: np.ndarray, G: np.ndarray) -&gt; np.ndarray:</div><div class="cm-line">    """Toy antibracket: sum over elementwise derivative approximations."""</div><div class="cm-line">    return np.sum(F * G - G * F, axis=-1)</div><div class="cm-gap" style="height: 560px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="b17b1c73-63a3-4e4e-b9cb-7a0760a416fc" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-mini" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="149">âœ… Created <strong data-start="10" data-end="31"><code data-start="12" data-end="29">bv_formalism.py</code></strong> â€” includes ghost/antifield initialization, toy antibracket, classical master equation evaluation, and BV Laplacian.</p>
<p data-start="151" data-end="214">With this, the <strong data-start="166" data-end="211">core theoretical modules are now complete</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="216" data-end="402" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Next, we can implement the <strong data-start="243" data-end="263">analysis modules</strong> (<code data-start="265" data-end="286">neuro_validation.py</code>, <code data-start="288" data-end="304">cosmo_tests.py</code>, <code data-start="306" data-end="324">meta_analysis.py</code>) to complete the full suite. Do you want to start with <code data-start="380" data-end="401">neuro_validation.py</code>?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.3320