ass="hidden sm:block"><button class="flex items-center gap-1 py-1 ps-1.5 pe-2.5 select-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50">Download</button></span></div><div class="hover:text-token-text-primary"><button class="btn relative btn-primary -my-1 -me-3 flex items-center gap-1 py-1 select-none"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><span class="" data-state="closed"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="block sm:hidden"><path d="M6 14.7229V5.27708C6 4.29072 7.08894 3.69295 7.9211 4.22251L15.3428 8.94541C16.1147 9.43661 16.1147 10.5634 15.3428 11.0546L7.92109 15.7775C7.08894 16.307 6 15.7093 6 14.7229Z"></path></svg></span><span class="hidden sm:block">Run code</span></div></button></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1 flex-col self-end"><div class="relative flex min-h-0 flex-auto flex-col overflow-hidden border-t transition-colors border-transparent"><section class="popover flex h-full w-full flex-col bg-transparent"><section class="relative flex min-h-0 flex-auto grow flex-col overflow-hidden"><div class="block h-auto"><div class="flex justify-start h-full" style="margin: 0px 16px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex h-full max-w-full"><div id="codemirror" class="_codemirror_hsqxh_1 _preview_hsqxh_26 z-10 flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch" style="width: 0px;"><div class="cm-editor Í¼1 Í¼2 Í¼13 Í¼14 Í¼12"><div class="cm-announced" aria-live="polite"></div><div tabindex="-1" class="cm-scroller" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><div spellcheck="false" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" translate="no" contenteditable="false" style="tab-size: 4;" class="cm-content" role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-readonly="true"><div class="cm-line">"""</div><div class="cm-line">lattice_solver.py</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">Finite-difference 2D/3D lattice solver for RSVP fields (Phi, V, S).</div><div class="cm-line">Supports optional GPU acceleration via Numba/CuPy.</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">Purpose:</div><div class="cm-line">- Evolve fields according to discrete PDEs</div><div class="cm-line">- Support core solver testing and entropy evolution studies</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">Inputs:</div><div class="cm-line">- Phi, V, S arrays (numpy)</div><div class="cm-line">- dt: time step</div><div class="cm-line">- n_steps: number of iterations</div><div class="cm-line">- use_gpu: boolean flag for GPU acceleration</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">Outputs:</div><div class="cm-line">- Updated Phi, V, S arrays</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">Testing Focus:</div><div class="cm-line">- Convergence with grid resolution</div><div class="cm-line">- Stability under different dt and n_steps</div><div class="cm-line">"""</div><div class="cm-line">from __future__ import annotations</div><div class="cm-line">from typing import Tuple</div><div class="cm-line">import numpy as np</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">try:</div><div class="cm-line">    import cupy as cp</div><div class="cm-line">    GPU_AVAILABLE = True</div><div class="cm-line">except ImportError:</div><div class="cm-line">    GPU_AVAILABLE = False</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">try:</div><div class="cm-line">    from numba import njit, prange</div><div class="cm-line">    NUMBA_AVAILABLE = True</div><div class="cm-gap" style="height: 518px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="6e499bd4-406d-48dd-8a4e-dc5663b05137" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-mini" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><div class="flex