SVP simulations.</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">Purpose:</div><div class="cm-line">- Automatically detect if CuPy/Numba GPU acceleration is available.</div><div class="cm-line">- Provide unified interface for choosing CPU/GPU.</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">Outputs:</div><div class="cm-line">- GPU availability flag</div><div class="cm-line">- Recommended backend</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">Testing Focus:</div><div class="cm-line">- Detection logic across systems</div><div class="cm-line">"""</div><div class="cm-line">from __future__ import annotations</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">GPU_AVAILABLE = False</div><div class="cm-line">BACKEND = 'cpu'</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">try:</div><div class="cm-line">    import cupy as cp</div><div class="cm-line">    GPU_AVAILABLE = True</div><div class="cm-line">    BACKEND = 'gpu_cupy'</div><div class="cm-line">except ImportError:</div><div class="cm-line">    try:</div><div class="cm-line">        from numba import cuda</div><div class="cm-line">        GPU_AVAILABLE = cuda.is_available()</div><div class="cm-line">        BACKEND = 'gpu_numba' if GPU_AVAILABLE else 'cpu'</div><div class="cm-line">    except ImportError:</div><div class="cm-line">        GPU_AVAILABLE = False</div><div class="cm-line">        BACKEND = 'cpu'</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">def select_backend(prefer_gpu: bool = True) -&gt; str:</div><div class="cm-gap" style="height: 210px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section></div></div></div></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="90855043-fe98-43f9-b911-86c604abb4d6" dir="auto" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-mini" data-aria