<p data-start="1234" data-end="1266"><strong data-start="1234" data-end="1266">Structure for each notebook:</strong></p>
<ol data-start="1267" data-end="1886">
<li data-start="1267" data-end="1290">
<p data-start="1270" data-end="1290"><strong data-start="1270" data-end="1290">Title / Metadata</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1291" data-end="1360">
<p data-start="1294" data-end="1360"><strong data-start="1294" data-end="1313">Imports &amp; Setup</strong> â€“ including RSVP modules, plotting, logging.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1361" data-end="1428">
<p data-start="1364" data-end="1428"><strong data-start="1364" data-end="1389">Simulation Parameters</strong> â€“ lattice size, dt, Î», n_steps, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1429" data-end="1495">
<p data-start="1432" data-end="1495"><strong data-start="1432" data-end="1456">Field Initialization</strong> â€“ random fields or placeholder data.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1496" data-end="1561">
<p data-start="1499" data-end="1561"><strong data-start="1499" data-end="1517">Run Experiment</strong> â€“ call relevant solver or suite function.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1562" data-end="1638">
<p data-start="1565" data-end="1638"><strong data-start="1565" data-end="1584">Compute Metrics</strong> â€“ coherence, Î£Ì‡, min/max values, scaling exponents.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1639" data-end="1725">
<p data-start="1642" data-end="1725"><strong data-start="1642" data-end="1660">Visualizations</strong> â€“ field heatmaps, Î£Ì‡ plots, coherence matrices, scaling plots.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1726" data-end="1793">
<p data-start="1729" data-end="1793"><strong data-start="1729" data-end="1749">Logging &amp; Export</strong> â€“ JSONL logs, optional manifest tracking.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1794" data-end="1886">
<p data-start="1797" data-end="1886"><strong data-start="1797" data-end="1829">Next Steps / Extension Cells</strong> â€“ placeholders for user modifications or dataset import.</p>
</li>
