break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="161">Perfect â€” this set of four modules already forms a clean, cohesive <strong data-start="67" data-end="90">RSVP Analysis Suite</strong> foundation. Each module isolates a conceptual layer of the RSVP model:</p>
