b-3! border-0 border-t sm:mx-[1px]"><div class="writing-block-editor relative px-4 sm:px-5"><div contenteditable="true" aria-disabled="false" translate="no" class="ProseMirror markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full min-h-6 break-words focus:outline-none"><p><span>"""</span><br><span>config.py</span></p><p><span>Configuration layer for the RSVP Analysis Suite (RAS).</span></p><p><span>Defines:</span></p><ul data-spread="false"><li><p><span>Global constants and default parameters (grid sizes, timestep, random seed)</span></p></li><li><p><span>Paths and directory layout</span></p></li><li><p><span>Simple configuration registry (using a dict)</span></p></li><li><p><span>Environment introspection (NumPy, SciPy, matplotlib versions)</span></p></li><li><p><span>Reproducibility helpers (set_random_seed)</span></p></li></ul><p><span>This module centralizes settings so that each RAS module can import from </span><code><span>config</span></code><br><span>rather than hard-coding parameters. It is safe to modify per-experiment.</span><br><span>"""</span></p><p><span>from </span><strong><span>future</span></strong><span> import annotations</span><br><span>from typing import Any, Dict</span><br><span>import os</span><br><span>import platform</span><br><span>import numpy as np</span></p><p><span>try:</span><br><span>import scipy</span><br><span>except Exception:</span><br><span>scipy = None</span></p><p><span>try:</span><br><span>import matplotlib</span><br><span>except Exception:</span><br><span>matplotlib = None</span></p><h1><span>----------------------------- Default parameters -----------------------------</span></h1><p><span>DEFAULTS: Dict<span data-placeholder-token="true" class="text-token-text-primary cursor-text" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--selection) 20%, transparent); padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px;">[str, Any]</span> = {</span><br><span>"grid_size": 64,</span><br><span>"time_step": 0.01,</span><br><span>"random_seed": 42,</span><br><span>"experiment_root": "experiments",</span><br><span>"phi_alpha": 1.0,</span><br><span>}</span></p><h1><span>----------------------------- Configuration registry -----------------------------</span></h1><p><span>CONFIG: Dict<span data-placeholder-token="true" class="text-token-text-primary cursor-text" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--selection) 20%, transparent); padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px;">[str, Any]</span> = DEFAULTS.copy()</span></p><p><span>def set_param(key: str, value: Any) -&gt; None:</span><br><span>"""Set a configuration parameter globally."""</span><br><span>CONFIG<span data-placeholder-token="true" class="text-token-text-primary cursor-text" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--selection) 20%, transparent); padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px;">[key]</span> = value</span></p><p><span>def get_param(key: str, default: Any = None) -&gt; Any:</span><br><span>"""Retrieve a configuration parameter."""</span><br><span>return CONFIG.get(key, default)</span></p><p><span>def reset_to_defaults() -&gt; None:</span><br><span>"""Reset CONFIG to defaults."""</span><br><span>CONFIG.clear()</span><br><span>CONFIG.update(DEFAULTS)</span></p><h1><span>----------------------------- Environment &amp; reproducibility -----------------------------</span></h1><p><span>def set_random_seed(seed: int | None = None) -&gt; np.random.Generator:</span><br><span>"""Set the global random seed for NumPy and return a Generator."""</span><br><span>if seed is None:</span><br><span>seed = CONFIG<span data-placeholder-token="true" class="text-token-text-primary cursor-text" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--selection) 20%, transparent); padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px;">["random_seed"]</span></span><br><span>np.random.seed(seed)</span><br><span>return np.random.default_rng(seed)</span></p><p><span>def environment_report() -&gt; Dict<span data-placeholder-token="true" class="text-token-text-primary cursor-text" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--selection) 20%, transparent); padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px;">[str, Any]</span>:</span><br><span>"""Return basic environment info for reproducibility logs."""</span><br><span>info = {</span><br><span>"python_version": platform.python_version(),</span><br><span>"platform": platform.platform(),</span><br><span>"numpy_version": np.</span><strong><span>version</span></strong><span>,</span><br><span>}</span><br><span>if scipy is not None:</span><br><span>info<span data-placeholder-token="true" class="text-token-text-primary cursor-text" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--selection) 20%, transparent); padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px;">["scipy_version"]</span> = scipy.</span><strong><span>version</span></strong><br><span>if matplotlib is not None:</span><br><span>info<span data-placeholder-token="true" class="text-token-text-primary cursor-text" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--selection) 20%, transparent); padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px;">["matplotlib_version"]</span> = matplotlib.</span><strong><span>version</span></strong><br><span>return info</span></p><p><span>if </span><strong><span>name</span></strong><span> == "</span><strong><span>main</span></strong><span>":</span><br><span>print("RSVP Analysis Suite configuration demo")</span><br><span>print("Defaults:", DEFAULTS)</span><br><span>rng = set_random_seed()</span><br><span>print("Random sample:", rng.normal())</span><br><span>print("Environment:", environment_report())</span></p></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none invisible fixed start-0 top-0 h-0 overflow-clip"><div><div role="toolbar" aria-orientation="horizontal" dir="ltr" class="bg-token-main-surface-primary m-0 flex h-9 w-fit min-w-0 shrink items-center overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-1 dark:bg-[#353535] shadow-[0_8px_12px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.16),0_0_1px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.60)] dark:shadow-[0_8px_16px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.40),inset_0_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.25),0_0_1px_0_rg