<li data-start="133" data-end="237">
<p data-start="135" data-end="237">A <code data-start="137" data-end="156">unittest.TestCase</code> subclass for each module (<code data-start="183" data-end="203">FieldEquationTests</code>, <code data-start="205" data-end="230">LatticeConvergenceTests</code>, etc.)</p>
