<p data-start="5526" data-end="5670">âœ… These four files, along with the earlier <code data-start="5569" data-end="5585">semantic_phase</code> test, give you a <strong data-start="5603" data-end="5639">full importable <code data-start="5621" data-end="5631">unittest</code> suite</strong> for all core modules in RAS.</p>
<p data-start="5672" data-end="5812">They cover: numerical correctness, shapes, basic statistical properties, plotting sanity (no rendering), I/O integrity, and config behavior.</p>
<hr data-start="5814" data-end="5817">
